    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "纽约时报将 Oracle 迁移到 Aurora PostgreSQL",
      "summary": "AWS 复盘《纽约时报》将 PLATO 订阅收入系统从 Oracle 迁到 Aurora PostgreSQL：项目从预计 18 个月压缩到 5 个月，上线达到 18,500 requests/s，AWS 称切换无收入中断且逐行数据准确率为 100%。团队处理约 11 万项转换、三套 Schema 和超过 8,000 个应用文件，使用 DMS Schema Conversion、持续复制与自动化工作流。上线前仍需独立验证转换与业务切换。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/the-new-york-times-cut-oracle-migration-time-from-18-to-5-months/",
      "author": "Eli DOE、Rohit Arora、Shashank Nigam、Manoj Duvva",
      "source": "AWS Database Blog",
      "source_date": "2026-10-26",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/10/05/DBBLOG-5718-featured-image.png",
